  "full_text": "So let's be clear. We are better than this. Are you ready to see a beta male? This is a beta male. Same hotel? Same price? No. There's a bunch of different prices out there all over the internet. Make things hot. Just think of all the lasers in sci-fi. Laser guns. Laser shooting out of your eyes. Laser cutting, burning tumors with lasers. And lasers can be used to burn your hair off. Hey, Derek from Veritasium. Hey, Diana from Physics Girl. So there's one more interesting use of lasers. What's that? It's very different. It's laser cooling. Are you going to keep going? Or do you want me to say something like, what's laser cooling? So I first learned about laser cooling in college, and it was one of those moments where I just couldn't believe that the world worked this way. It's really counterintuitive. Get me out of here, Terry.",
